# ESGenuine — Metric Improvement Plan

> **Goal:** Raise the three weakest scores — **Fact-check/Evidence (3)**, **Production Readiness (4)**, and **Data Quality/Extraction (5.5)** — from their current ratings to 7+ through targeted, high-leverage work.

## Current State Summary

| Metric | Rating | Core Blockers |
|--------|--------|---------------|
| Fact-check / evidence | **3** | 3 illustrative records, 4–46% coverage, decorative fact-check, blocked on real data |
